GenerateBitmap levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia barusudir\stay_alive.dds
DuplicateTag levels\multi\s3d_turf\shaders\checker.shader levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia
EditTag levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia.shader
SetBitmap base_map levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia.bitmap
SaveTagChanges
Exit

DuplicateTag dw3\r3ach\sound\weapons\plasma_rifle\prifle_heat_loop\prifle_heat_loop\loop.sound levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia
EditTag levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia.sound
ImportSound barusudir\~STAY_ALIVE~.mp3
SetField Flags FitToAdpcmBlocksize,NeverObstruct,InternalDontTouch,FakeSpatializationWithDistance
SetField SoundClass DeviceStationary
AddBlockElements ExtraInfo
SetField Playback.FieldDisableFlags DistanceA,DistanceB,DirectionalAttenuation
SetField Playback.DistanceParameters.MinimumDistance 3
SetField Playback.DistanceParameters.MaximumDistance 22
SetField Playback.GainBase 0
SetField Scale.GainModifierBounds 0 0
SetField Scale.PitchModifierBounds 0 0
SetField MaximumPlayTime 0
SetField PitchRanges[0].Permutations[0].Gain 15
SetField PitchRanges[0].Permutations[0].SkipFraction 1
SetField PitchRanges[0].Permutations[0].SampleCount 0
SaveTagChanges
Exit

DuplicateTag dw3\r3ach\sound\weapons\plasma_rifle\prifle_heat_loop\prifle_heat_loop.sound_looping levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia
EditTag levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia.sound_looping
SetField SoundClass DeviceStationary
SetField Flags 0
SetField DistanceBounds 3 22
SetField Tracks[0].Gain 0
SetField Tracks[0].Loop levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia.sound
SaveTagChanges
Exit

DuplicateTag sound\levels\solo\m52\sound_scenery\disco_music_alt\disco_music_alt.crate levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia
EditTag levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia.crate
SetField Attachments[0].Type levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia.sound_looping
SaveTagChanges
Exit

Foreach mode startingwith: objects\eldewrito\reforge\ AddBlockElements Materials
Foreach mode startingwith: objects\eldewrito\reforge\ SetField Materials[*].RenderMethod levels\multi\another_world\subaru_emilia.shader

